{"id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-compositional-completeness.md","title":"组合公理恢复全部闭项统一基础去引号","display":"thm-compositional-completeness — 组合公理恢复全部闭项统一基础去引号","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-compositional-completeness","aliases":["91-thm-compositional-completeness","91-thm-CT-completeness","91-thm-compositional-derivation"],"display":"thm-compositional-completeness — 组合公理恢复全部闭项统一基础去引号","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-CT]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-compositional-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-compositional-completeness</span><span>91-thm-CT-completeness</span><span>91-thm-compositional-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compositional-completeness — 组合公理恢复全部闭项统一基础去引号"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66b3ab8406681395\" href=\"?note=66b3ab8406681395\" title=\"91-df-compositional-truth\">91-df-compositional-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 为固定标准矩阵，列出全部自由变量；闭项代入、求值量词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 使用原书基础语言六条编码公理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\)</span> 只含算术归纳。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a> 的完整真理语言归纳版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash\\forall\\vec t\\,\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))\\bigr)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash\\forall\\vec t\\,\n\\bigl(T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))\\bigr)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\subseteq\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\qquad\\mathrm{UTB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{CT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\subseteq\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\qquad\\mathrm{UTB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{CT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>元理论对标准矩阵复杂度归纳，同时保留其自由变量：原子步用项求值和等式公理；布尔步用组合子句；量词步让闭项遍历标准及模型内部表示的项，配合基础算术的替换和求值性质。所证明的是每个矩阵的对象统一句，未在对象理论中量化全部矩阵。\n全归纳 UTB 是 CT 的子理论；但 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 只包含 UTB 的算术归纳版本。文件名 completeness 不表示理论的语义完备或决定全部算术句。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 8.4 及其结构归纳证明，印刷页 66–67，PDF 页 77–78；Definition 8.28。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-truth","status":"resolved","id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-CT]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}$ 为固定标准矩阵，列出全部自由变量；闭项代入、求值量词见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CT}$ 为 [[91-df-CT]] 的完整真理语言归纳版本。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}","display":false},{"te